2f:["$","$L30",null,{"product":{"name":"Black Lace Table Runner – 72 inch","slug":"black-lace-table-runner-72-inch","description":"The Black Lace Table Runner – 72 Inch. Featuring a beautiful gothic lace design, this decorative table runner is perfect for Halloween parties, horror-themed dinners, haunted house décor, and festive table arrangements. Its stylish black lace pattern creates a mysterious and classy atmosphere while enhancing your dining or party table décor. Made from lightweight and durable fabric, this 72-inch table runner is ideal for dining tables, buffet tables, coffee tables, dessert counters, and party setups. The intricate lace detailing pairs perfectly with candles, pumpkins, skulls, and other Halloween decorations to create a stunning gothic-inspired display.","price":7.99,"compareAtPrice":10.99,"currency":"USD","categorySlug":"home-decoration","images":["https://halloweenready.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/table-rubber.png"],"inventory":200,"tags":["Black Lace Table Runner","Gothic Table Runner","Halloween Table Décor"],"seoTitle":"Black Lace Table Runner – 72 inch","seoDescription":"The Black Lace Table Runner – 72 Inch. Featuring a beautiful gothic lace design, this decorative table runner is perfect for Halloween parties,…"},"relatedProducts":[{"name":"Halloween Banner – Happy Halloween Cloth","slug":"halloween-banner-happy-halloween-cloth","description":"Welcome guests in spooky style with the Halloween Banner – Happy Halloween Cloth. Featuring a festive &#8220;Happy Halloween&#8221; message and eye-catching seasonal designs, this reusable cloth banner is perfect for Halloween parties, haunted houses, classrooms, offices, photo booths, and home decorations. Made from durable fabric material, the banner is lightweight, easy to hang, and suitable for both indoor and outdoor use. The vibrant Halloween-themed design adds a fun and festive atmosphere to walls, doorways, porches, party backdrops, and event spaces. Perfect for Halloween celebrations, trick-or-treat events, school functions, and seasonal gatherings, this decorative banner creates an impressive focal point while pairing beautifully with balloons, pumpkins, spider webs, and other spooky decorations.","price":5.99,"compareAtPrice":8,"currency":"USD","categorySlug":"home-decoration","images":["https://halloweenready.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Halloween-Enamel-Pin-Set-–-5-Pins-1.png"],"inventory":200,"tags":["Cloth Halloween Banner","Halloween Banner","Halloween Party Decorations","Happy Halloween Banner"],"seoTitle":"Halloween Banner – Happy Halloween Cloth","seoDescription":"Welcome guests in spooky style with the Halloween Banner – Happy Halloween Cloth."},{"name":"Pumpkin Luminary Paper Bags – 12 Pack","slug":"pumpkin-luminary-paper-bags-12-pack","description":"Light up your Halloween celebrations with the Pumpkin Luminary Paper Bags – 12 Pack. These festive paper luminary bags feature spooky pumpkin-themed designs that create a warm and glowing Halloween atmosphere for parties, pathways, gardens, patios, and haunted house setups. Simply place LED candles or lights inside to create beautiful illuminated decorations for nighttime celebrations. Perfect for lining walkways, driveways, staircases, entrances, balconies, and party areas, these pumpkin luminary bags instantly add a magical spooky touch to your décor. Their classic Halloween pumpkin print makes them ideal for trick-or-treat nights, horror-themed events, cafés, shops, and festive gatherings.","price":5.99,"compareAtPrice":8.66,"currency":"USD","categorySlug":"home-decoration","images":["https://halloweenready.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Untitled-design-15-10.png"],"inventory":200,"tags":["Halloween Decoration","Halloween Paper Bags","Pumpkin Luminary Bags"],"seoTitle":"Pumpkin Luminary Paper Bags – 12 Pack","seoDescription":"Light up your Halloween celebrations with the Pumpkin Luminary Paper Bags – 12 Pack."},{"name":"Black Crow/Raven Prop – Set of 2","slug":"black-crow-raven-prop-set-of-2","description":"Add a creepy haunted touch to your Halloween décor with the Black Crow/Raven Prop – Set of 2. These realistic black bird props are perfect for creating spooky scenes in haunted houses, Halloween parties, gothic décor setups, and horror-themed events. Designed with detailed feathers and lifelike appearance, these raven decorations instantly enhance the eerie atmosphere of any space. Perfect for placing on walls, trees, fences, tables, shelves, pumpkins, tombstones, or party backdrops, these lightweight crow props are easy to position and reusable for multiple Halloween celebrations. Their classic black gothic style pairs perfectly with skeletons, cobwebs, candles","price":9.99,"compareAtPrice":12.34,"currency":"USD","categorySlug":"home-decoration","images":["https://halloweenready.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Untitled-design-15-9.png"],"inventory":200,"tags":["Black Raven Prop","Crow Halloween Decoration","Raven Halloween Decor"],"seoTitle":"Black Crow/Raven Prop – Set of 2","seoDescription":"Add a creepy haunted touch to your Halloween décor with the Black Crow/Raven Prop – Set of 2."},{"name":"Orange & Black Balloon Pack – 50pcs","slug":"orange-black-balloon-pack-50pcs","description":"Decorate your Halloween party in style with the Orange & Black Balloon Pack – 50pcs. This festive balloon set includes 50 premium latex balloons in classic Halloween colors, orange and black, perfect for creating spooky party decorations, balloon arches, photo booth backdrops, and haunted house setups. Each balloon measures 12 inches, making them ideal for indoor and outdoor celebrations. Use them to decorate walls, ceilings, entrances, dessert tables, event stages, or party venues for a fun and spooky Halloween atmosphere. The vibrant color combination perfectly matches Halloween themes, horror parties, and festive décor setups. Made from durable latex material, these balloons are lightweight, easy to inflate, and suitable for helium or air filling. Perfect for Halloween parties, birthdays, school events, cafés, shops, and horror-themed celebrations, this balloon pack instantly adds excitement and festive charm to any space.","price":7.99,"compareAtPrice":10,"currency":"USD","categorySlug":"home-decoration","images":["https://halloweenready.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Orange-Black-Balloon-Pack-–-50pcs-1.png","https://halloweenready.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Orange-Black-Balloon-Pack-–-50pcs-2.png"],"inventory":200,"tags":["Halloween Balloons","Halloween Party Decoration","Orange Black Balloons"],"seoTitle":"Orange & Black Balloon Pack – 50pcs","seoDescription":"Decorate your Halloween party in style with the Orange & Black Balloon Pack – 50pcs."},{"name":"Fake Cobweb Roll – Large Pack 50g","slug":"fake-cobweb-roll-large-pack-50g","description":"Create a creepy haunted atmosphere with the Fake Cobweb Roll – Large Pack 50g. Made from stretchy cotton-style material, this fake spider web decoration is perfect for transforming homes, haunted houses, party venues, and Halloween setups into spooky horror scenes. The lightweight webbing can be stretched across walls, ceilings, furniture, windows, staircases, trees, and party backdrops for a realistic cobweb effect. This large 50g pack provides wide coverage, making it ideal for decorating indoor and outdoor spaces with ease. Pair it with plastic spiders, skeletons, pumpkins, and other Halloween props to create an even more terrifying display. Reusable and easy to apply, this fake cobweb decoration is perfect for Halloween parties, horror-themed events, spooky photo booths, cafés, shops, and festive home décor. It instantly adds a creepy and realistic haunted touch to any space.","price":3.28,"compareAtPrice":5,"currency":"USD","categorySlug":"home-decoration","images":["https://halloweenready.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/fake-cow-bell-roll.png"],"inventory":200,"tags":["Fake Cobweb Decoration","Fake Cobweb Roll – Large Pack 50g","Fake Spider Web","Halloween Spider Web"],"seoTitle":"Fake Cobweb Roll – Large Pack 50g","seoDescription":"Create a creepy haunted atmosphere with the Fake Cobweb Roll – Large Pack 50g."}]}]
